<blockquote>प्रीलिम्स तथ्य: <b>BIMSTEC = Bay of Bengal Initiative for Multi-Sectoral Technical and Economic Cooperation</b>; मुख्यालय <b>ढाका</b>; 7 सदस्य; गठन <b>1997, बैंकॉक घोषणा</b>।</blockquote>

